1
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:05,140
Enhance Armament!

2
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:35,470
Oh, my God.

3
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,830
Kirito!

4
00:01:00,913 --> 00:01:01,743
Say something!

5
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,120
Kirito!

6
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,480
With no strong thoughts,
I can't wait for you.

7
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,480
I'll go ahead and go!

8
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:23,240
If your voice doesn't exist,

9
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:29,100
I can't tell you?

10
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:46,457
Thank

11
00:01:46,540 --> 00:01:47,857
you

12
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:54,940
so

13
00:01:57,820 --> 00:01:59,060
much for watching.

14
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:14,057
Thank

15
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:15,457
you

16
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:22,540
so

17
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,139
much for watching.

18
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,060
Kirito!

19
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,720
Come on, wake up!

20
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:46,477
System Call!

21
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,560
Generate Luminous Elements!

22
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,100
System Call!

23
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:01,000
Transfer human unit durability.

24
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,620
Self to lift.

25
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,840
Don't die.

26
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:11,940
That's enough, Eugeo.

27
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:14,180
I think I'll be okay now.

28
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,380
Whoa, take it easy.

29
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,151
You were hurt pretty bad.

30
00:03:18,540 --> 00:03:21,617
You might have internal wounds
my healing didn't catch.

31
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:24,700
It's not as bad as when
those goblins beat me down.

32
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:28,300
Anyway, I'm worried about her. What?

33
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,260
Who cares?

34
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,522
She tried to kill you, remember?

35
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:38,160
I know what you said before, about
letting hate get the better of me.

36
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,480
She was just doing her duty.

37
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:44,114
She wasn't fighting for revenge
or because she hated us.

38
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,260
I get that.

39
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:48,580
Still, that's no excuse.

40
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:51,779
I can't forgive the church
or the Integrity Knights.

41
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,997
They have all this power, but
they're just a bunch of hypocrites.

42
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:59,060
If they really wanted to
protect humanity, they could.

43
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,680
They'd rather protect a lie instead.

44
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:07,216
I know what you mean, but you can't
forget these knights are human too.

45
00:04:07,460 --> 00:04:11,560
They got their own problems, like
how this one felt about her gender.

46
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:17,720
I gotta say, your perfect
weapon control art's awesome.

47
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,885
Those knights didn't
stand a chance against it.

48
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:22,840
This fight's over.

49
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:27,437
There's no reason to hate Fanatio
and the Four Whirling Blades anymore.

50
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,560
So let it go.

51
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,360
They're human.

52
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:33,680
Yeah, you're right.

53
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:37,181
I understood that much
about her during the fight.

54
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:39,220
She fought with heart like us.

55
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,774
I guess that's why she was so powerful.

56
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,017
You're right about that.

57
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:46,453
It's all a matter of perspective
when you think about it.

58
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:50,247
The knights see themselves as
good while you see them as evil.

59
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:53,445
But the reality is, you,
me, and these knights,

60
00:04:53,740 --> 00:04:56,500
we're all human at the end of the day.

61
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:59,160
So who's to say who's good and who's bad?

62
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:01,560
Crap, almost forgot.

63
00:05:02,980 --> 00:05:06,617
Could you give those two knuckleheads
some of that antidote for me?

64
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:09,377
Don't forget to snap their
daggers before you do.

65
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:12,695
Oh, and make sure they're
not packing any other tricks.

66
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:15,340
What about Administrator Kirito?

67
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:19,720
Will you be as understanding
of her as you are her knights?

68
00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:34,720
System call!

69
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,649
Generate luminous element!

70
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:42,800
What's wrong?

71
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:46,680
I can't stop the bleeding.
Help me! Alright.

72
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:52,440
This isn't working.

73
00:05:52,780 --> 00:05:54,545
She's lost way too much blood.

74
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:58,740
But I can't just let her die like this.

75
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:03,360
She's lived a hundred years
worrying, loving, suffering.

76
00:06:03,820 --> 00:06:05,140
She was alive.

77
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:07,300
I can't let her soul get erased.

78
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,500
Help us.

79
00:06:08,620 --> 00:06:09,738
This night's dying.

80
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:13,180
I know there's more of
you out there. Come on.

81
00:06:13,340 --> 00:06:14,634
One of you needs help.

82
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:16,680
Can anyone hear me?

83
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:19,140
A priest, a monk, anyone?

84
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,880
She's dying! Help her!

85
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,940
Please, you can't let her die!

86
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:29,210
That's it?

87
00:06:30,380 --> 00:06:31,897
What do you think you're doing?

88
00:06:31,980 --> 00:06:34,627
You're supposed to use
that on Administrator!

89
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:35,890
Yeah, I know.

90
00:06:35,973 --> 00:06:38,074
But if I use it on her, I can save her.

91
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,367
This tagger's her only hope.

92
00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:41,933
I can save her with it.

93
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,660
I have to use it!

94
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:59,940
Goodness gracious, you
really are something.

95
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:02,620
Cardinal, she needs help.

96
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:05,337
I'm sorry, I know I shouldn't have...

97
00:07:05,420 --> 00:07:08,479
I know what's happened, and
please, don't apologize.

98
00:07:09,140 --> 00:07:12,660
I will heal Fanatio
Synthesis too. However,

99
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,697
I will have to bring her to me,

100
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:17,956
as it will take some time
to initiate a full recovery.

101
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:24,960
These potions will heal you.

102
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:29,920
Now, as far as I can tell, Administrator
is not yet in her waking state.

103
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:33,558
If you can make it to the
top floor before she wakes,

104
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:37,092
you can still eliminate her
without the use of the dagger.

105
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:40,240
Hurry, only a few
Integrity Knights remain.

106
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:44,140
I kinda lost it there, sorry.

107
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:47,216
No, you don't ever have to apologize.

108
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,860
Hey, did you get that?

109
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:00,334
Cardinal said something weird just now.

110
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:03,460
Something about
Administrator's waking state?

111
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,687
Perhaps she spends most
of her time sleeping.

112
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:10,537
Cardinal said Administrator
and some of her

113
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:12,837
knights have been around
for a couple of centuries,

114
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:15,861
so who knows what kind of
strain that puts on him.

115
00:08:16,300 --> 00:08:17,917
Maybe it's part of the deal.

116
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:21,140
Administrator has to sleep
all day to stay alive.

117
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:24,501
Well, I guess we'll find
out once we get up there.

118
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:42,640
The heck is this?

119
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:52,330
Watch out!

120
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:53,578
Something's coming!

121
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,160
Thank you for waiting.

122
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,798
Which floor would you like to visit?

123
00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:22,300
Which floor?

124
00:09:23,220 --> 00:09:26,455
Do you mean you can take us
to any of the floors above?

125
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:35,120
Um, we're fugitives, and we sort
of, like, broke into the cathedral.

126
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:40,000
Isn't your elevator, I mean, floating
thing off-limits to folks like us?

127
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,908
I'm not sure what you mean.

128
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:45,162
Anyone who wishes to use
this platform may do so.

129
00:09:45,300 --> 00:09:48,100
My job is to merely
operate it, nothing more.

130
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,390
Okay.

131
00:09:50,473 --> 00:09:52,315
We'll take you up on your offer, then.

132
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:53,960
Hey, wait!

133
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,040
Are you sure it's safe?

134
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,660
Of course.

135
00:09:58,020 --> 00:10:00,217
Besides, there's no more stairs to climb.

136
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,437
Yeah, but...

137
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,680
never mind.

138
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:04,410
All right.

139
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:06,736
Please take us up as high as you can.

140
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,181
Right away, sir.

141
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:12,560
System call.

142
00:10:12,980 --> 00:10:14,860
Generate aerial element.

143
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:20,940
Burst element.

144
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:34,662
So, uh, have you been
doing this for a while now?

145
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,440
As a matter of fact, I have.

146
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,260
For 107 years, actually.

147
00:10:42,140 --> 00:10:43,100
107 years?

148
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:47,220
And this is all you do day
in and day out? Not quite.

149
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:48,260
I get breaks.

150
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:51,537
I'm allowed to take one
at noon to have my lunch.

151
00:10:51,620 --> 00:10:54,920
And then at night, I get
to sleep, so there's that.

152
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:57,140
That's not quite what I mean.

153
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:59,440
Um, what's your name?

154
00:11:00,060 --> 00:11:01,100
My name.

155
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:04,180
I seem to have forgotten it.

156
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,260
That makes sense.

157
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:09,200
Operator is all anyone calls me anymore.

158
00:11:12,180 --> 00:11:14,020
I think we can help.

159
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:18,180
We, um, we came here to bring
down the head of the church.

160
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:20,872
The one who forced this calling onto you.

161
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:22,680
You don't say?

162
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:26,997
If the church is gone, you'll
be released from your calling.

163
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:29,374
You'll be free to do whatever you want.

164
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,620
Is that so?

165
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:34,120
I'm at a loss.

166
00:11:34,340 --> 00:11:37,516
I don't know anything of the
world outside this shaft.

167
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:41,960
Therefore, I have no idea what
new calling I would choose.

168
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:48,480
Although, if I could wish
for anything else to do…

169
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:58,020
I wish I could fly this platform
outside, and go wherever I wanted.

170
00:12:08,820 --> 00:12:10,277
Thank you for your patience.

171
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:13,440
This is the 80th floor,
the Cloud Top Garden.

172
00:12:14,820 --> 00:12:18,757
I didn't think anything in this world
could be more boring than my calling,

173
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,940
but it's nothing compared to hers.

174
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:24,800
I could look forward to
growing old and retiring.

175
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,560
She's stuck with hers forever.

176
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:32,577
Cardinal said that even if you stopped
a person from aging with the sacred art,

177
00:12:32,660 --> 00:12:35,307
there's no way to stop
their soul from aging.

178
00:12:35,820 --> 00:12:40,055
Little by little, their memory crumbles,
and in the end, it falls apart.

179
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,840
The Axiom Church is straight-up evil.

180
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:49,764
We're the only ones who can stop
Administrator and free everyone.

181
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,040
It's a start.

182
00:12:51,860 --> 00:12:54,684
But that's not the end
of this world's problems.

183
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:57,500
The real challenge is what comes after.

184
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:03,024
I thought after we defeated Administrator,
Cardinal would make things right again.

185
00:13:03,740 --> 00:13:04,570
Won't she?

186
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:07,590
Sort of.

187
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:11,380
We can talk about it after
we get Alice back. Okay.

188
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:34,180
Oh, amazing.

189
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,270
Alice…

190
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:10,520
Please wait.

191
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:13,140
I want to let her soak in the sun.

192
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:15,140
Not for long.

193
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:17,240
A few more moments will do.

194
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:23,620
Let me do the fighting, okay?

195
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:25,591
Be ready with the dagger.

196
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:28,977
That's the only way
you're gonna get her back.

197
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:32,740
I'll block her strikes with my
body if it comes down to it.

198
00:14:33,980 --> 00:14:34,937
But can't we...

199
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,608
Look, there's no other way.

200
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:39,737
I'll charge Alice, take
the hit and pin her down.

201
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:42,380
Then you stick her with
the dagger. Got it?

202
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:44,210
Sorry.

203
00:14:44,293 --> 00:14:45,617
Nah, don't worry about it.

204
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:48,112
If this works, you can pay me back later.

205
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:51,537
I can't tell if she's
got her sword or not.

206
00:14:51,620 --> 00:14:53,020
Eh, it doesn't matter.

207
00:14:53,340 --> 00:14:56,617
We'll get to her before she can finish
casting her perfect weapon control.

208
00:14:56,700 --> 00:15:01,641
But we gotta attack now, because the more
we wait, the more time she has to cast it.

209
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:03,050
You're right.

210
00:15:03,133 --> 00:15:04,740
And if she does finish casting it,

211
00:15:04,940 --> 00:15:08,757
I think I can use mine two more
times before I have to restore it.

212
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,428
And that's our backup plan.

213
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,820
I can only use mine one more time.

214
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:17,117
And we still gotta deal with the
Commander of the Knights after Alice.

215
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,940
Come on, let's do this.

216
00:15:21,620 --> 00:15:25,091
Against all odds, you two have
made it all the way up here.

217
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:28,780
I anticipated your escape from the prison,

218
00:15:29,060 --> 00:15:31,800
but I did not anticipate
what happened next.

219
00:15:32,260 --> 00:15:35,277
Eldrie should have caught
you, yet you defeated him.

220
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,360
Then Deo Selbert.

221
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:37,900
I have no idea how.

222
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:40,880
And then, you defeated Fanatio as well.

223
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,220
And now, you have set foot here.

224
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:44,760
It is shocking.

225
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:47,937
Where do you get the power
to overcome such knights?

226
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:50,860
Why do you wish to disrupt the Order here?

227
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:52,400
Explain yourselves.

228
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:55,140
Very well.

229
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,500
I will get answers with my blade.

230
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:01,720
No way.

231
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,640
Damn it! Her sword!

232
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:13,660
It's already in perfect control!

233
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:47,660
Why did you not draw your swords?

234
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:50,080
If you were mocking me, know this.

235
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:54,240
I intentionally held back on that
strike just now as a warning.

236
00:16:54,580 --> 00:16:57,462
The next one shall eliminate
your lives entirely.

237
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:03,260
For the honor of the knights you've
defeated, I insist you attack me in earnest.

238
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,360
System call.

239
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:11,680
Please accept our humble apologies.

240
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:14,960
We didn't mean to disrespect you just now.

241
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:17,760
My name is Kirito.

242
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:22,320
I'm a swordsman in training, and I
wish to duel with you, Lady Alice.

243
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:25,210
Very well.

244
00:17:25,780 --> 00:17:30,960
Let us see just how wicked you are
by the quality of your swordsmanship.

245
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:44,760
Before we start this up,
I got a question for you.

246
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:49,313
If that tree we saw just now is your
sword, that means it's its true form.

247
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:52,740
So how can a tree that
small be so powerful?

248
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:59,320
Long ago, the spot where the central
cathedral stands was the Place of Beginnings,

249
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:04,440
a place which Stacia, the goddess
of creation, gifted to humanity.

250
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:09,067
In the center of a tiny village,
there was a beautiful spring.

251
00:18:09,700 --> 00:18:13,200
On its banks, there grew
a single osmanthus tree.

252
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:14,940
This weapon,

253
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:16,397
the osmanthus blade,

254
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:20,397
was forged from it a tree created by

255
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:23,577
the goddess reincarnated the oldest

256
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:29,897
thing in existence a divine weapon
indeed everlasting eternity is its

257
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:36,857
attribute a single petal can split
stone or tear the ground asunder you

258
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:41,380
don't say that's a great score it's
this world's first indestructible?

259
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:45,720
Thanks for sharing, but we
should get back to business now.

260
00:18:47,740 --> 00:18:51,660
All right, Integrity Knight
Alice, if you're ready, on guard!

261
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:26,520
You are the second person to
withstand my attacks for this long.

262
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:29,500
Your will and dedication are apparent.

263
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:31,420
They brought you this far.

264
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:35,077
However, the church is far
greater than your will,

265
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:39,336
and I will not allow you to disturb
the peace of this realm any longer.

266
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:43,040
Farewell, human.

267
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,230
Enhance!

268
00:19:58,460 --> 00:19:59,560
I'm in it!

269
00:20:14,860 --> 00:20:16,480
Oh, my God.

270
00:20:41,500 --> 00:20:45,280
Well, now that was
amusing and quite futile.

271
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:47,960
Mere ice cannot withstand my flowers.

272
00:20:48,460 --> 00:20:50,220
I shall fight you next.

273
00:20:50,460 --> 00:20:52,740
So be patient and wait your turn.

274
00:20:54,980 --> 00:20:56,340
Enhance armament!

275
00:21:04,220 --> 00:21:05,820
He went for my sword!

276
00:21:06,140 --> 00:21:07,420
Now use you!

277
00:21:36,220 --> 00:21:39,020
Kirito, Alice.

278
00:21:52,980 --> 00:21:54,380
No!

279
00:21:59,180 --> 00:22:00,580
Kirito!

280
00:22:01,380 --> 00:22:02,560
Alice!

281
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:25,710
processingSo

282
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:38,060
Next time, Truce.
